          <li>Energetic, independent, bold</li>
          <li>Impulsive but highly driven</li>
          <li>Compatible with Leo &amp; Sagittarius</li>
        </ul>
        <span class="arg-rashi-element">&#128293; Fire</span>
      </div>

      <div class="arg-rashi-card">
        <div class="arg-rashi-top">
          <div class="arg-rashi-icon">&#9801;</div>
          <div><div class="arg-rashi-name">Taurus (Vrishabha)</div><div class="arg-rashi-hindi">&#2357;&#2371;&#2359;&#2349;</div></div>
        </div>
        <div class="arg-rashi-lord">Ruling Planet: Venus &nbsp;&#183;&nbsp; Earth Sign</div>
        <div class="arg-rashi-dates">May 15 &ndash; Jun 14 &nbsp;&#183;&nbsp; Symbol: Bull &#9801;</div>
        <ul class="arg-rashi-traits">
          <li>Patient, reliable &amp; practical</li>
          <li>Deeply loyal and dependable</li>
          <li>Loves beauty, comfort &amp; luxury</li>
          <li>Compatible with Virgo &amp; Capricorn</li>
        </ul>
        <span class="arg-rashi-element">&#127758; Earth</span>
      </div>

      <div class="arg-rashi-card">
        <div class="arg-rashi-top">
          <div class="arg-rashi-icon">&#9802;</div>
          <div><div class="arg-rashi-name">Gemini (Mithuna)</div><div class="arg-rashi-hindi">&#2350;&#2367;&#2341;&#2369;&#2344;</div></div>
        </div>
        <div class="arg-rashi-lord">Ruling Planet: Mercury &nbsp;&#183;&nbsp; Air Sign</div>
        <div class="arg-rashi-dates">Jun 15 &ndash; Jul 14 &nbsp;&#183;&nbsp; Symbol: Twins &#9802;</div>
        <ul class="arg-rashi-traits">
          <li>Witty, versatile &amp; curious</li>
          <li>Excellent communicator</li>
          <li>Loves learning &amp; variety</li>
          <li>Compatible with Libra &amp; Aquarius</li>
        </ul>
        <span class="arg-rashi-element">&#127744; Air</span>
      </div>

      <div class="arg-rashi-card">
        <div class="arg-rashi-top">
          <div class="arg-rashi-icon">&#9803;</div>
          <div><div class="arg-rashi-name">Cancer (Kark)</div><div class="arg-rashi-hindi">&#2325;&#2352;&#2381;&#2325;</div></div>
        </div>
        <div class="arg-rashi-lord">Ruling Planet: Moon &nbsp;&#183;&nbsp; Water Sign</div>
